CPEDAL 1
NAME "Naga Viper / Hydra Treble Booster"

# Direct circuit adaptation of the Catalinbread Naga Viper signal path using
# Aion FX Hydra documentation (stated by Aion to have no circuit changes).
# Reverse-polarity protection and supply-decoupling parts are omitted from the
# audio model; VA is represented as an ideal 9 V rail.

V VASRC VA 0 9
AUDIO GUITAR INPUT 0 0.20

# Input loading and variable Range capacitor blend.
R RPD INPUT 0 2M2
C C1 INPUT 0 1n
C C2 INPUT BASE 3n3
POT RANGE C3_IN INPUT INPUT 500k LOG 0.50
C C3 C3_IN BASE 68n

# Rangemaster-derived 2N2222 stage.
R R1 VA BASE 220k
R R2 BASE 0 68k
Q Q1 COLLECTOR BASE EMITTER 2N2222A
C C4 BASE COLLECTOR 47p

# Collector/output control. Boost wiper is AC-coupled to the output.
POT BOOST VA BOOST_W COLLECTOR 10k LIN 0.70
C C6 BOOST_W OUT 10n

# Emitter bias plus Heat-controlled AC bypass.
R R3 EMITTER 0 8k2
C C5 EMITTER HEAT_NODE 47u
POT HEAT HEAT_NODE HEAT_NODE 0 1k LIN 0.70

OUTPUT OUT 1
